      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Intro&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;intro&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#intro&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Where to begin? I&amp;rsquo;m honestly glad I can get the chance to start writing here. It will be interesting to see where this website ends up in the future. It will also be fun to track my progress as a developer, seeing all the projects that I have done added to this neat collection.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
